  "2026-09-25T17:59:30.446Z","harness:codex","Adapted upstream skill and campaign at e0d80000067d224e93af6107ed093a21e046879f, preserving MIT copyright. Added four-question authoring gate, contract/keeper evidence ledger, SDK versus transport ownership, public sdk/testing retention, isolated pre-fix controls, and prohibition on coverage denominator/gate weakening. Linked from developer workflow and skill index. Validation: pnpm build and docs-skills gate passed; explicit new-skill frontmatter, relative links, and reference reachability passed after correcting tracker path. This is guidance adaptation, not execution of a repository test-deletion campaign or a claim of fresh full-suite coverage."
